{"id":"n91792-1-8","stage":4,"title":"유연하다 · 柔软","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91792-1-8-1","ko":"요즘 요가를 배우러 다닌다며?","zh":"听说你最近在学瑜伽？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"요가를","meaning":"瑜伽","explanation":"요가：瑜伽；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"요가","audio":"/audio/a8b7acbd87590861fefa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69181","senseId":"1","lemma":"요가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요가를","audio":"/audio/3476d058d438cce74a90.mp3"}},{"text":"배우러","meaning":"学，学习","explanation":"배우다：学，学习；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"배우다","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62088","senseId":"2","lemma":"배우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배우러","audio":"/audio/46afc25ac15d01786d5c.mp3"}},{"text":"다닌다며?","meaning":"常去","explanation":"다니다：常去；ㄴ다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"1","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다닌다며","audio":"/audio/cfbeb31db138ae65493d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"a8b7acbd87590861","term":"요가","zh":"瑜伽","audio":"/audio/a8b7acbd87590861fefa.mp3","entryId":"69181","definition":"从古印度流传下来的锻炼身心的方法。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"2c65351237177855","term":"배우다","zh":"学，学习","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3","entryId":"62088","definition":"熟悉新技术。","pronunciation":["배우다"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"常去","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"经常出入某个地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f75ccae9393f7a01bad0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91792-1-8-2","ko":"응, 그런데 몸이 유연하지 않아서 정말 힘들어.","zh":"对，可是我的身体不够灵活，真的好难啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"그런데","meaning":"可是，但是","explanation":"그런데：可是，但是。","readings":[{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70717","senseId":"2","lemma":"그런데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}},{"text":"몸이","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸이","audio":"/audio/5a8fb4d5acf8e6fe3214.mp3"}},{"text":"유연하지","meaning":"柔软，柔韧","explanation":"유연하다：柔软，柔韧；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"유연하다","audio":"/audio/4de7bdefff723d71484d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91792","senseId":"1","lemma":"유연하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유연하지","audio":"/audio/9cbbc40eb5dbaf7bb8bc.mp3"}},{"text":"않아서","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않아서","audio":"/audio/56e46f9e2892c9f61489.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"힘들어.","meaning":"难，困难，费劲，难以","explanation":"힘들다：难，困难，费劲，难以；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"2","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘들어","audio":"/audio/42a96966a9378057f47c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"30c94182141ace2f","term":"그런데","zh":"可是，但是","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3","entryId":"70717","definition":"用于表达与前面内容相反的内容。","pronunciation":["그런데"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"4de7bdefff723d71","term":"유연하다","zh":"柔软，柔韧","audio":"/audio/4de7bdefff723d71484d.mp3","entryId":"91792","definition":"温和柔润。","pronunciation":["유연하다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"难，困难，费劲，难以","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"做某事不简单或不容易。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4a0fe41df3de9a829d41.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.989,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91792","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급